# 基本

- order: 0

`getValue` `setValue` `reset` 的使用

:::lang=en-us
# basic

- order: 0

usage of `getValue` `setValue` `reset`
:::
---


````jsx
import { Input, Button, Field } from '@alifd/next';



class App extends React.Component {
    field = new Field(this);

    onGetValue() {
        console.log(this.field.getValue('input'));
